    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1729503821896\" id=\"item-67161f569955481e683978ca\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-video video-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/34418.js&quot;,&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.video\" data-sqsp-block=\"video\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"intrinsic\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n    \n      \n    \n    <div\n      class=\"embed-block-wrapper\"\n      style=\"padding-bottom:56.49999999999999%;\"\n    >\n      <div\n        class=\"sqs-video-wrapper\"\n        data-provider-name=\"YouTube\"\n        data-html=\"&lt;iframe width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;113&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/d3MJGfMVo1c?feature=oembed&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allow=&quot;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&quot; allowfullscreen title=&quot;Niseko AirBnB Real Estate Videography | PropertyMedia Japan&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"\n        data-localized=\"{&quot;invalidVideo&quot;:&quot;Invalid video embed.&quot;,&quot;playButton&quot;:&quot;Play&quot;}\"\n        data-config-loading=\"\"\n      >\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546 .intrinsic {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-video-block-blend);\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-video-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546 .intrinsic {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n  <style>#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546 { border-width: 0; height: auto; }</style>\n  \n  \n  \n    <style>\n    \n      \n    \n      \n        @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546 { background-color: transparent; }\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729507795120_35546 .intrinsic { background-color: var(--tweak-video-block-background-color); }\n        }\n      \n    \n    </style>\n  \n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729500377900_34610\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:<br></strong>Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Explore Modern Living with Traditional Touches at Makkari Air BnB, Niseko</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Positioned in the heart of Niseko, Makkari Air BnB merges contemporary design with traditional Japanese aesthetics, offering a unique living experience. This property, constructed on a spacious lot, features a multi-level design that maximizes both style and functionality.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>4 Bedrooms &amp; 2 Bathrooms</strong>: Each bedroom combines modern comfort with traditional elements, providing a serene retreat. The bathrooms are equipped with up-to-date fixtures to ensure a comfortable stay.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>2 Living Rooms</strong>: Spacious and inviting, with one room featuring a traditional tatami area that offers a quintessential Japanese experience. The other living room is equipped with modern furnishings and a cozy setup, perfect for relaxation and social gatherings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Open Kitchen &amp; Dining Area</strong>: A fully equipped kitchen with ample cabinetry and modern appliances, adjacent to a spacious dining area that caters to family meals and entertaining guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Efficient Layout</strong>: Includes a laundry area, a compact yet functional kitchen, and versatile living spaces that ensure practical daily living and exceptional guest accommodation.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Scenic Views and Natural Light</strong>: Large windows in every room offer sweeping views of the surrounding landscape and fill the home with natural light, enhancing the airy and open feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Access</strong>: Balconies and a well-maintained garden provide a private outdoor retreat where one can enjoy the serene setting and crisp air of Niseko.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage</strong>: A single-car garage with additional storage space, ensuring convenience and security for vehicles and outdoor gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located just minutes from local amenities and the vibrant life of Niseko, Makkari Air BnB offers an idyllic setting for both peaceful living and adventurous getaways. Whether looking for a permanent residence or a holiday home, this property promises a blend of tradition and modernity, set in one of Japan\u2019s most sought-after locations.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-0 span-0\"></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;671623a4562d330726f21459&quot;,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:false,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;671